CIRCLE: there's no color called "reddish" (try "red", "skyblue", "#ff8800", or a number like 0xFF8800)
RECT doesn't have an option called spin (its options are anchor, angle, pivot, outline, alpha, scale, scale_x, scale_y, flip_x, flip_y, tint, smooth, radius, font, size, align and wrap)
RGB: red must be a whole number from 0 to 255
DRAW_TO needs the name of an image's variable, like DRAW_TO(background), so the drawing has somewhere to stay
